  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Reserved contracts for certain services",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Finalise and publish procurement pack",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that contracting authorities may reserve qualifying suppliers the right to participate in procurement procedures, where the services to be procured are covered by the Common Procurement Vocabulary (CPV) codes as set out in this regulation (i.e. regulation 77).",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In such circumstances, a supplier will be considered a “qualifying organisation” where:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "its objective is the pursuit of a public service linked to one of the CPV codes covered by this regulation",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "its profits are reinvested into achieving the suppliers’ objective",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the management or ownership structure of the supplier is based on employee ownership or participatory principles (or require the active participation of employees, users or stakeholders), and",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the supplier has not been awarded, pursuant to this regulation, a reserved contract for services by the contracting authority within the past 3 years.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracts awarded under this regulation shall not have a duration longer than 3 years",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Where this regulation (i.e. regulation 77) is relied on to reserve qualified suppliers the right to participate in the procurement, this should be clearly specified in the contract notice.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that, where applicable, the call for competition includes a clear reference to this regulation to reserve qualifying organisations (as defined by this regulation) the right to participate in the procurement.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reserved contracts for certain services",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 33: Reserving contracts to public service mutuals",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
